### AVDownloader (2026, V.1)
This is an download software based on FFMPEG and YT-DLP
You doesn't need to download any other dependancies

## How to use ?
1 - Open the software
2 - Copy-Paste your link
3 - Select an audio or video version (for this V.1, the quality is the best possible, .opus for the audio selection and .mp4 for the video)
4 - Click on Download 

## Known Issues :
1 - The info-bar isn't working properly, you have to leave and rejoind the window to know if the downloading is finished
2 - This is a french version, sorry for that, but I think you can reach the end...
3 - Some fonctionnalities aren't inplemented in the software now

This issues will be fixed on the weeks that are coming.
If you found new ones, you can e-mail me to my adress

